OL,3,GNEWSA'Our industry is still male
OL,4,Adominated, but things are changing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a significant increase
OL,7,Fin the number of women studying for
OL,8,Fengineering degrees in Northern
OL,9,FIreland, new figures show.
OL,11,FOver the last 10 years the number of
OL,12,Ffemale students studying Mechanical
OL,13,FEngineering at Queen's University has
OL,14,Fincreased by 40%, while at Ulster
OL,15,FUniversity the number studying
OL,16,Fengineering has almost doubled over the
OL,17,Fpast decade.
OL,19,FBut employment figures also show that
OL,20,Fthe engineering and wider manufacturing
OL,21,Findustries in Northern Ireland are
OL,22,Fstill male dominated.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
