OL,3,GNEWSA'Our industry is still male
OL,4,Adominated, but things are changing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow a group of women working in the
OL,7,Fengineering industry in Mid Ulster are
OL,8,Fraising awareness about the
OL,9,Fopportunities for women in the sector.
